            "description": {
              "content": "Starts a named performance transaction on the device to measure a discrete user flow, optionally enabling HAR network capture for the transaction window. Used to mark the beginning of a segment for which performance metrics (and network traffic) should be collected; close it with the stop-transaction call.",
